# filter with always-false predicate on a bounded range produces empty seq;
# $head of an empty seq raises E034 (empty collection).
# Note: filter with an infinite seq and always-false predicate loops indefinitely
# (the internal loop skips without depth accumulation). Using a bounded input here.
[head [filter [fn [n] false] [take 100 [range 0]]]]
===
[E034]
